llustrations, and character names uploaded to Aathirai_Comic remain the exclusive intellectual property of the respective registered author. Aathirai_Comic acts strictly as a non-exclusive digital distributor and publishing facilitator.\n\n2. GRANT OF LIMITED DIGITAL DISTRIBUTION LICENSE:\nBy submitting and publishing a comic on Aathirai_Comic, the author grants the platform a revocable, non-exclusive digital hosting license solely to render pages for registered readers, facilitate secure INR Razorpay transactions, and promote the work on homepage showcases.\n\n3. DIGITAL RIGHTS MANAGEMENT & WATERMARKING:\nAll comic pages served through the Aathirai_Comic reader utilize encrypted image streaming to prohibit unauthorized digital extraction and scraping.\n\n4. INFRINGEMENT REPORTING & TAKEDOWN (DMCA & INDIAN COPYRIGHT ACT 1957 COMPLIANCE):\nAny copyright holder noticing unauthorized re-upload of protected artwork can file an instant infringement notice via copyright@aathirai.com. Notices will be reviewed within 24 business hours by the Administrator.","status":"published","effectiveDate":"2026-01-01","lastUpdated":"2026-11-01"},{"id":"cpy_2","title":"Statutory Copyright Notice & DMCA Compliance Guidelines","documentNumber":"AAT-CPY-2026-02","registeredEntity":"Aathirai Media & Publishing Pvt Ltd","summary":"Statutory compliance details under Section 52 of the Indian Copyright Act 1957 and International Digital Millennium Copyright Act protocols.","fullText":"All rights reserved worldwide. The compilation of comics, web layout, brand identifiers, logo, and digital reading mechanisms of Aathirai_Comic are protected under Indian and international copyright treaties.\n\nNo portion of any comic hosted on this platform may be reproduced, mirrored, syndicated, or translated without prior written permission from the designated author or Aathirai_Comic publishing operations.","status":"published","effectiveDate":"2026-01-01","lastUpdated":"2026-11-01"}],"settings":{"siteName":